68
00:04:54,280 --> 00:05:02,560
Okay. So specs, this is something you'll hear very, very often, especially in technical areas, but it means specifications or details.

69
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:09,880
So maybe I have a computer and I know it's an IBM computer, but I don't know the specs.

70
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:10,960
I don't have the details.

71
00:05:12,270 --> 00:05:19,290
So that's something that you would want to find out if you have a problem or you want to look into it more closely. And so specs.

72
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:20,390
That's right.

73
00:05:20,790 --> 00:05:22,450
